x; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">（取自<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSRone</span>永續觀點臉書）</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">去年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">556</span>家公司出版<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSR<span>&nbsp;</span></span>上市櫃占<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">92.3%</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">〔記者陳永吉／台北報導〕根據<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSRone</span>永續智庫出版的《<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020</span>台灣暨亞太永續報告現況與趨勢》專書統計，台灣去年共有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">556</span>家公司出版<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSR</span>（企業永續報告書），其中上市櫃公司占了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">92.3%</span>。值得注意的是，有出版<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSR</span>的公司，不只<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">EPS</span>（每股稅後盈餘）高於台股平均值，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ROE</span>（股東權益報酬率）連<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>年也高於台股平均表現。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">CSRone</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">表示，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年台灣共出版<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">556</span>本企業永續報告書，說明企業於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年度的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSR</span>作為。其中又以金融保險業、化學工業以及電子零組件業三大產業對<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSR</span>最為積極。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">另根據統計，台灣<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年營收百大企業之中，僅剩<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">9</span>家企業尚未出版永續報告。而獲得證交所與櫃買中心「第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>屆公司治理評鑑」前<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5%</span>公司，則還有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8</span>家企業（上市<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>家、上櫃<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">7</span>家）尚未出版企業永續報告。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">ROE</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">連<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>年也高於台股平均表現</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">研究報告同時顯示，出版永續報告的上市櫃公司，其<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">EPS</span>為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3.69</span>元，高於台股大盤的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.49</span>元以及未出版報告書的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.14</span>元，且為連續<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>年皆優於台股大盤，而且優勢有逐年擴大的態勢。而<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ROE</span>也有相同的趨勢，出版永續報告書之上市櫃公司<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">ROE</span>為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8.66%</span>，高於台股大盤的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5.72%</span>以及未出版報告書的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4.50%</span>，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5</span>年來也都是如此。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">目前金管會規定，股本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">50</span>億元以上的上市櫃公司以及與民生密切相關的食品、金融、化工等產業，每年必須出版企業社會責任（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSR</span>）報告書。<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CSRone</span>表示，對企業而言，出版報告書不僅符合法律規範，又可以提升企業品牌形象與聲譽、瞭解營運風險、創造差異化價值、盤點內部營運、落實節能減碳、延攬優秀人才與營運資訊透明等，可謂好處多多。以致國內企業多數願意每年花費<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">80</span>萬至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">100</span>萬元編製，甚至多花<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">15</span>萬至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">25</span>萬元取得第三方驗證，提高可信度。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/paper/1361270</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-03-25","clk_count":"203"}},"__N_SSG":true}